PATHS:
- inspect: the first decision
- review: reached by inspect.control-total, inspect.map-issues, inspect.tidy-status
  later facts known on every path: ai-draft
  later facts known on only some paths: raw-sum, inventory, text-fix
- resolve: reached by review.verify-edits
  later facts known on every path: ai-draft, verified-rules, known-subtotal
  later facts known on only some paths: raw-sum, inventory, text-fix
- subtotal-sent: reached by resolve.broader-review
  later facts known on every path: ai-draft, verified-rules, known-subtotal
  later facts known on only some paths: raw-sum, inventory, text-fix
- clean-sent: reached by resolve.receipt-check
  later facts known on every path: ai-draft, verified-rules, known-subtotal, receipt, final-total, change-log
  later facts known on only some paths: raw-sum, inventory, text-fix
- draft-sent: reached by review.use-draft
  later facts known on every path: ai-draft
  later facts known on only some paths: raw-sum, inventory, text-fix

